{"id":"p5-13-zh-001","language":"zh","category":"paraphrase","text":"我把伞落在车上了。换句话说，我下车时忘了拿伞。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-001","language":"en","category":"paraphrase","text":"I left my umbrella on the bus. In other words, I got off without it.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-001","language":"ja","category":"paraphrase","text":"バスに傘を置いてきた。つまり、降りるときに持ち忘れた。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-002","language":"zh","category":"paraphrase","text":"把灯调暗一点，也就是让它别这么亮。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-002","language":"en","category":"paraphrase","text":"Dim the lamp a little. I mean, make it less bright.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-002","language":"ja","category":"paraphrase","text":"明かりを少し落として。今より暗くしてほしい。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-003","language":"zh","category":"paraphrase","text":"来得最早的是小夏。换个说法，小夏第一个到。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-003","language":"en","category":"paraphrase","text":"Nora arrived earliest. To put it another way, she got there first.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-003","language":"ja","category":"paraphrase","text":"一番早く着いたのは夏だよ。夏が最初に来たんだ。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-004","language":"zh","category":"paraphrase","text":"我想延期，就是想换到晚一点的日子。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-004","language":"en","category":"paraphrase","text":"I'd like to postpone it, to move it to a later date.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-004","language":"ja","category":"paraphrase","text":"延期したい。もう少し先の日に移したいんだ。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-005","language":"zh","category":"paraphrase","text":"这里打烊了，意思是今天已经关门了。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-005","language":"en","category":"paraphrase","text":"They've closed up here. The shop is shut for the day.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-005","language":"ja","category":"paraphrase","text":"ここは店じまいした。今日はもう閉まっているということ。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-006","language":"zh","category":"paraphrase","text":"不妨坐地铁吧。我的意思是，我们可以搭地下铁去。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-006","language":"en","category":"paraphrase","text":"Let's take the subway. We could get there by metro.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-006","language":"ja","category":"paraphrase","text":"地下鉄にしよう。電車で地下を通って行くってこと。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-007","language":"zh","category":"paraphrase","text":"他把零钱分给两个人，两个人各拿了一半。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-007","language":"en","category":"paraphrase","text":"He split the change equally between the two of them. Each got half.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-007","language":"ja","category":"paraphrase","text":"二人に小銭を等分した。どちらも半分ずつ受け取った。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-008","language":"zh","category":"paraphrase","text":"我指的是窗边那张桌子，靠窗的那一张。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-008","language":"en","category":"paraphrase","text":"I mean the table by the window, the one right next to the glass.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-008","language":"ja","category":"paraphrase","text":"窓際のテーブルだよ。窓にくっついている方。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-009","language":"zh","category":"paraphrase","text":"请用铅笔写，拿可以擦掉的那支笔。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-009","language":"en","category":"paraphrase","text":"Use the pencil, the one whose marks you can erase.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-009","language":"ja","category":"paraphrase","text":"鉛筆で書いて。消しゴムで消せる方の筆記具だよ。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-010","language":"zh","category":"paraphrase","text":"我对花生过敏，换句话说，我吃花生会起过敏反应。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-010","language":"en","category":"paraphrase","text":"I'm allergic to peanuts. Eating them gives me an allergic reaction.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-010","language":"ja","category":"paraphrase","text":"ピーナッツアレルギーなんだ。食べるとアレルギー反応が出る。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-011","language":"zh","category":"paraphrase","text":"借阅期满，也就是说这本书到归还的日子了。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-011","language":"en","category":"paraphrase","text":"The loan period is over. The book is due back.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-011","language":"ja","category":"paraphrase","text":"貸出期間が終わった。つまり、本を返す日が来たんだ。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-012","language":"zh","category":"paraphrase","text":"我选无糖的，就是不加糖的那杯。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-012","language":"en","category":"paraphrase","text":"I'll have the unsweetened one, the cup with no sugar added.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-012","language":"ja","category":"paraphrase","text":"無糖にするよ。砂糖を入れていない方ね。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-013","language":"zh","category":"negation","text":"我没说钥匙丢了。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-013","language":"en","category":"negation","text":"I didn't say the keys were lost.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-013","language":"ja","category":"negation","text":"鍵をなくしたとは言っていない。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-014","language":"zh","category":"negation","text":"昨天没有下雨，至少我出门时没有。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-014","language":"en","category":"negation","text":"It didn't rain yesterday, at least while I was outside.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-014","language":"ja","category":"negation","text":"昨日は雨が降らなかった。少なくとも外にいた間は。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-015","language":"zh","category":"negation","text":"我不讨厌芹菜，只是不常买。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-015","language":"en","category":"negation","text":"I don't dislike celery. I just rarely buy it.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-015","language":"ja","category":"negation","text":"セロリが嫌いなわけじゃない。めったに買わないだけ。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-016","language":"zh","category":"negation","text":"别把名字写在信封上。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-016","language":"en","category":"negation","text":"Don't write the name on the envelope.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-016","language":"ja","category":"negation","text":"封筒には名前を書かないで。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-017","language":"zh","category":"negation","text":"盒子里既没有硬币，也没有邮票。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-017","language":"en","category":"negation","text":"There are neither coins nor stamps in the box.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-017","language":"ja","category":"negation","text":"箱には硬貨も切手も入っていない。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-018","language":"zh","category":"negation","text":"我还没读完最后一章。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-018","language":"en","category":"negation","text":"I haven't finished the last chapter yet.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-018","language":"ja","category":"negation","text":"最終章はまだ読み終えていない。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-019","language":"zh","category":"negation","text":"并不是所有椅子都坏了。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-019","language":"en","category":"negation","text":"Not all of the chairs are broken.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-019","language":"ja","category":"negation","text":"椅子が全部壊れたわけじゃない。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-020","language":"zh","category":"negation","text":"我没有同意周五见面。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-020","language":"en","category":"negation","text":"I haven't agreed to meet on Friday.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-020","language":"ja","category":"negation","text":"金曜に会うことには同意していない。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-021","language":"zh","category":"negation","text":"没有人说演出取消了。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-021","language":"en","category":"negation","text":"Nobody said the performance was cancelled.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-021","language":"ja","category":"negation","text":"公演が中止だと言った人はいない。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-022","language":"zh","category":"negation","text":"别担心，我不会动你桌上的画。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-022","language":"en","category":"negation","text":"Don't worry, I won't move the drawing on your desk.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-022","language":"ja","category":"negation","text":"心配しないで。机の上の絵は動かさないよ。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-023","language":"zh","category":"negation","text":"我今天没戴手表，也没看手机时间。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-023","language":"en","category":"negation","text":"I didn't wear a watch today or check the time on my phone.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-023","language":"ja","category":"negation","text":"今日は腕時計をしなかったし、携帯で時刻も見なかった。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-024","language":"zh","category":"condition","text":"如果周六放晴，我们就去海边。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-024","language":"en","category":"condition","text":"If it's clear on Saturday, we'll go to the beach.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-024","language":"ja","category":"condition","text":"土曜に晴れたら海に行こう。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-025","language":"zh","category":"condition","text":"只有收到确认邮件，我才会订房。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-025","language":"en","category":"condition","text":"I'll only book the room if I get a confirmation email.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-025","language":"ja","category":"condition","text":"確認メールが来た場合にだけ部屋を予約する。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-026","language":"zh","category":"condition","text":"要是门锁着，就把书放在前台。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-026","language":"en","category":"condition","text":"If the door is locked, leave the book at reception.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-026","language":"ja","category":"condition","text":"ドアに鍵がかかっていたら、本は受付に置いて。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-027","language":"zh","category":"condition","text":"除非电车晚点，否则我七点到。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-027","language":"en","category":"condition","text":"I'll arrive at seven unless the train is delayed.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-027","language":"ja","category":"condition","text":"電車が遅れない限り、七時に着く。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-028","language":"zh","category":"condition","text":"面团太干的话，可以加一点水。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-028","language":"en","category":"condition","text":"If the dough is too dry, add a little water.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-028","language":"ja","category":"condition","text":"生地が乾きすぎていたら、水を少し加えて。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-029","language":"zh","category":"condition","text":"假如两种颜色都有，我选绿色。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-029","language":"en","category":"condition","text":"If both colors are available, I'll choose green.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-029","language":"ja","category":"condition","text":"両方の色があるなら、緑を選ぶ。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-030","language":"zh","category":"condition","text":"你若想听，我就从头讲。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-030","language":"en","category":"condition","text":"If you'd like to hear it, I'll start at the beginning.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-030","language":"ja","category":"condition","text":"聞きたいなら最初から話すよ。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-031","language":"zh","category":"condition","text":"票卖光了就改看明天的场次。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-031","language":"en","category":"condition","text":"If tickets sell out, we'll go to tomorrow's showing.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-031","language":"ja","category":"condition","text":"券が売り切れたら、明日の回にしよう。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-032","language":"zh","category":"condition","text":"如果我忘了带杯子，请提醒我。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-032","language":"en","category":"condition","text":"Please remind me if I forget my cup.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-032","language":"ja","category":"condition","text":"私がカップを忘れそうなら声をかけて。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-033","language":"zh","category":"condition","text":"只要她愿意，座位就给她留着。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-033","language":"en","category":"condition","text":"As long as she wants it, we'll save her the seat.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-033","language":"ja","category":"condition","text":"本人が希望するなら、その席は空けておく。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-034","language":"zh","category":"condition","text":"要是没找到那张发票，这次就先不报销。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-034","language":"en","category":"condition","text":"If the receipt can't be found, hold off on the reimbursement.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-034","language":"ja","category":"condition","text":"領収書が見つからなければ、今回は精算を見送る。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-035","language":"zh","category":"wish","text":"我希望明年能学会游泳。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-035","language":"en","category":"wish","text":"I hope I can learn to swim next year.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-035","language":"ja","category":"wish","text":"来年こそ泳げるようになりたい。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-036","language":"zh","category":"wish","text":"真想再听一次那首曲子。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-036","language":"en","category":"wish","text":"I wish I could hear that piece once more.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-036","language":"ja","category":"wish","text":"あの曲をもう一度聴きたいな。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-037","language":"zh","category":"wish","text":"但愿花开的时候她能看到。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-037","language":"en","category":"wish","text":"I hope she'll get to see the flowers in bloom.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-037","language":"ja","category":"wish","text":"花が咲く頃に、彼女にも見てもらえたらいいな。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-038","language":"zh","category":"wish","text":"我想有一张靠窗的书桌。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-038","language":"en","category":"wish","text":"I'd love a desk by the window.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-038","language":"ja","category":"wish","text":"窓際に机があったらいいな。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-039","language":"zh","category":"wish","text":"要是今天能早些回家就好了。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-039","language":"en","category":"wish","text":"I wish I could get home earlier today.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-039","language":"ja","category":"wish","text":"今日は早く帰れたらいいのに。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-040","language":"zh","category":"wish","text":"希望以后不用总换车。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-040","language":"en","category":"wish","text":"I hope I won't have to change buses so often in future.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-040","language":"ja","category":"wish","text":"これからは何度も乗り換えずに済むといいな。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-041","language":"zh","category":"wish","text":"我想尝尝那家店的栗子蛋糕。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-041","language":"en","category":"wish","text":"I'd like to try the chestnut cake at that bakery.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-041","language":"ja","category":"wish","text":"あの店の栗のケーキを食べてみたい。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-042","language":"zh","category":"wish","text":"愿这封信能及时送到。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-042","language":"en","category":"wish","text":"I hope this letter reaches them in time.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-042","language":"ja","category":"wish","text":"この手紙が間に合いますように。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-043","language":"zh","category":"wish","text":"我一直想自己做一把木勺。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-043","language":"en","category":"wish","text":"I've always wanted to carve a wooden spoon.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-043","language":"ja","category":"wish","text":"自分で木のスプーンを彫ってみたいとずっと思っている。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-044","language":"zh","category":"wish","text":"真希望音乐会能多办一天。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-044","language":"en","category":"wish","text":"I wish the concert ran for one more day.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-044","language":"ja","category":"wish","text":"コンサートがもう一日続けばいいのに。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-045","language":"zh","category":"wish","text":"我想把这段旋律记下来，免得忘了。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-045","language":"en","category":"wish","text":"I'd like to write down this tune before I forget it.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-045","language":"ja","category":"wish","text":"忘れる前に、この旋律を書き留めたい。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-046","language":"zh","category":"quotation","text":"阿遥说：“我明早去邮局。”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-046","language":"en","category":"quotation","text":"Hana said, “I'm going to the post office tomorrow morning.”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-046","language":"ja","category":"quotation","text":"遥が「明日の朝、郵便局に行く」と言った。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-047","language":"zh","category":"quotation","text":"标签上写着“请冷藏”。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-047","language":"en","category":"quotation","text":"The label says, “Keep refrigerated.”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-047","language":"ja","category":"quotation","text":"ラベルには「要冷蔵」と書いてある。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-048","language":"zh","category":"quotation","text":"老师问：“谁带了地图？”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-048","language":"en","category":"quotation","text":"The teacher asked, “Who brought the map?”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-048","language":"ja","category":"quotation","text":"先生が「地図を持ってきたのは誰？」と聞いた。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-049","language":"zh","category":"quotation","text":"他只说了“改天吧”，没说哪一天。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-049","language":"en","category":"quotation","text":"He only said, “Another day.” He didn't say which day.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-049","language":"ja","category":"quotation","text":"彼は「また今度」とだけ言って、日にちは言わなかった。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-050","language":"zh","category":"quotation","text":"我读到一句话：“影子也会越过河。”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-050","language":"en","category":"quotation","text":"I read this line: “Even shadows cross the river.”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-050","language":"ja","category":"quotation","text":"「影だって川を渡る」という一文を読んだ。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-051","language":"zh","category":"quotation","text":"她转述哥哥的话：“末班车已经走了。”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-051","language":"en","category":"quotation","text":"She quoted her brother: “The last bus has gone.”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-051","language":"ja","category":"quotation","text":"彼女は兄の「終バスはもう出たよ」という言葉を伝えた。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-052","language":"zh","category":"quotation","text":"纸条写着：“红盒给小秋，蓝盒留在这里。”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-052","language":"en","category":"quotation","text":"The note reads, “Give the red box to Jo and leave the blue one here.”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-052","language":"ja","category":"quotation","text":"メモには「赤い箱は秋に渡す。青い箱はここに置く」とある。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-053","language":"zh","category":"quotation","text":"“这不是我的杯子”，是客人说的。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-053","language":"en","category":"quotation","text":"“This isn't my cup,” said the guest.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-053","language":"ja","category":"quotation","text":"「これは私のカップじゃない」と言ったのはお客さんだ。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-054","language":"zh","category":"quotation","text":"我听见有人喊“慢一点！”，但没看见是谁。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-054","language":"en","category":"quotation","text":"I heard someone shout “Slow down!” but didn't see who it was.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-054","language":"ja","category":"quotation","text":"「ゆっくり！」と誰かが叫んだ。姿は見えなかった。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-055","language":"zh","category":"quotation","text":"她问我：“你真的说过‘我会等’吗？”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-055","language":"en","category":"quotation","text":"She asked me, “Did you really say ‘I'll wait’?”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-055","language":"ja","category":"quotation","text":"彼女が「本当に『待つよ』って言ったの？」と私に聞いた。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-056","language":"zh","category":"quotation","text":"照片背面只有“初雪那天”四个字。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-056","language":"en","category":"quotation","text":"All it says on the back of the photo is “the first snowfall.”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-056","language":"ja","category":"quotation","text":"写真の裏には「初雪の日」とだけ書いてある。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-057","language":"zh","category":"self_report","text":"我小时候住在河边。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-057","language":"en","category":"self_report","text":"I lived by a river as a child.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-057","language":"ja","category":"self_report","text":"子どもの頃、川の近くに住んでいた。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-058","language":"zh","category":"self_report","text":"我在学手语，刚学到问候。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-058","language":"en","category":"self_report","text":"I'm learning sign language and have just got to greetings.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-058","language":"ja","category":"self_report","text":"手話を習っていて、挨拶を覚えたところ。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-059","language":"zh","category":"self_report","text":"我喜欢深烘咖啡。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-059","language":"en","category":"self_report","text":"I like dark roast coffee.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-059","language":"ja","category":"self_report","text":"深煎りのコーヒーが好き。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-060","language":"zh","category":"self_report","text":"我今天把两盆薄荷换了土。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-060","language":"en","category":"self_report","text":"I repotted two mint plants today.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-060","language":"ja","category":"self_report","text":"今日はミントを二鉢植え替えた。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-061","language":"zh","category":"self_report","text":"我向来用左手写字。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-061","language":"en","category":"self_report","text":"I've always written with my left hand.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-061","language":"ja","category":"self_report","text":"昔から左手で字を書いている。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-062","language":"zh","category":"self_report","text":"我记不清第一次坐船是哪年了。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-062","language":"en","category":"self_report","text":"I can't remember the year I first went on a boat.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-062","language":"ja","category":"self_report","text":"初めて船に乗ったのが何年だったか思い出せない。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-063","language":"zh","category":"self_report","text":"我周日通常睡得比较晚。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-063","language":"en","category":"self_report","text":"I usually sleep in on Sundays.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-063","language":"ja","category":"self_report","text":"日曜はたいていゆっくり起きる。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-064","language":"zh","category":"self_report","text":"我刚才听错了站名。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-064","language":"en","category":"self_report","text":"I misheard the station name just now.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-064","language":"ja","category":"self_report","text":"さっき駅名を聞き間違えた。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-065","language":"zh","category":"self_report","text":"我会认乐谱，但不太会唱。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-065","language":"en","category":"self_report","text":"I can read music, but I don't sing very well.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-065","language":"ja","category":"self_report","text":"楽譜は読めるけれど、歌はあまり得意じゃない。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-066","language":"zh","category":"self_report","text":"我背包里有两支铅笔。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-066","language":"en","category":"self_report","text":"I have two pencils in my backpack.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-066","language":"ja","category":"self_report","text":"リュックに鉛筆が二本入っている。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-067","language":"zh","category":"self_report","text":"说实话，我还没想好要不要去。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-067","language":"en","category":"self_report","text":"Honestly, I still haven't decided whether to go.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-067","language":"ja","category":"self_report","text":"正直、行くかどうかはまだ決めていない。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-068","language":"zh","category":"correction","text":"我说错了，是周三，不是周四。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-068","language":"en","category":"correction","text":"I misspoke. It's Wednesday, not Thursday.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-068","language":"ja","category":"correction","text":"言い間違えた。木曜じゃなくて水曜だよ。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-069","language":"zh","category":"correction","text":"刚才报的是旧门牌，新门牌是十二号。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-069","language":"en","category":"correction","text":"I gave the old house number. The new one is twelve.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-069","language":"ja","category":"correction","text":"さっきのは古い番地で、新しいのは十二番だ。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-070","language":"zh","category":"correction","text":"把三杯改成两杯吧。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-070","language":"en","category":"correction","text":"Make that two cups instead of three.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-070","language":"ja","category":"correction","text":"三杯と言ったけど、二杯に変えて。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-071","language":"zh","category":"correction","text":"我记反了，小林才是弟弟。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-071","language":"en","category":"correction","text":"I had it backwards. Kai is the younger brother.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-071","language":"ja","category":"correction","text":"逆に覚えていた。林の方が弟だよ。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-072","language":"zh","category":"correction","text":"上一条里的“去年”应当是“前年”。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-072","language":"en","category":"correction","text":"In my last message, “last year” should say “the year before last.”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-072","language":"ja","category":"correction","text":"さっきの「去年」は「一昨年」の間違い。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-073","language":"zh","category":"correction","text":"更正一下，票已经付过钱了。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-073","language":"en","category":"correction","text":"Let me correct that. The tickets have already been paid for.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-073","language":"ja","category":"correction","text":"訂正するね。チケット代はもう払ってある。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-074","language":"zh","category":"correction","text":"不是她借我的，是我借她的。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-074","language":"en","category":"correction","text":"She didn't lend it to me. I lent it to her.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-074","language":"ja","category":"correction","text":"彼女から借りたんじゃない。私が彼女に貸した。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-075","language":"zh","category":"correction","text":"刚才那张照片拍的是湖，我误认成了海。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-075","language":"en","category":"correction","text":"The photo I showed was of a lake. I mistook it for the sea.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-075","language":"ja","category":"correction","text":"さっきの写真は湖だ。海と見間違えた。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-076","language":"zh","category":"correction","text":"请把名单上的“晓”改成“小”。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-076","language":"en","category":"correction","text":"Please change “Anne” on the list to “Ann.”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-076","language":"ja","category":"correction","text":"名簿の「有希」を「由紀」に直して。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-077","language":"zh","category":"correction","text":"等等，我找到钥匙了，前面说丢了那句作废。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-077","language":"en","category":"correction","text":"Wait, I've found the keys. Scratch what I said about losing them.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-077","language":"ja","category":"correction","text":"待って、鍵が見つかった。なくしたという話は取り消すよ。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-078","language":"zh","category":"correction","text":"我再算了一次，应付十六元。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-078","language":"en","category":"correction","text":"I added it up again. The total due is sixteen dollars.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-078","language":"ja","category":"correction","text":"計算し直したら、支払いは千六百円だった。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-079","language":"zh","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"小河把书递给阿青，她笑了。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-079","language":"en","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"Mina handed Sara the book and she smiled.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-079","language":"ja","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"美奈が沙羅に本を渡すと、彼女は笑った。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-080","language":"zh","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"两个杯子并排放着，把它挪近一点。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-080","language":"en","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"The cups are side by side. Move that one a little closer.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-080","language":"ja","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"カップが二つ並んでいる。それを少し手前に寄せて。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-081","language":"zh","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"哥哥和表哥都来了，他先回去了。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-081","language":"en","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"My brother and my cousin both came. He left first.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-081","language":"ja","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"兄と従兄が来た。彼は先に帰った。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-082","language":"zh","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"我看了两版海报，那张更清楚。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-082","language":"en","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"I saw both versions of the poster. That one's clearer.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-082","language":"ja","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"ポスターを二種類見た。そっちの方が見やすい。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-083","language":"zh","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"把那本放在这本旁边。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-083","language":"en","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"Put that book beside this one.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-083","language":"ja","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"あの本をこの本の横に置いて。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-084","language":"zh","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"小美告诉小雨，她的包还在车上。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-084","language":"en","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"May told Lily her bag was still in the car.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-084","language":"ja","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"美咲は由衣に、彼女の鞄がまだ車にあると伝えた。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-085","language":"zh","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"两场演出时间相同，我想看前面说的那个。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-085","language":"en","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"Both shows start at the same time. I want the one mentioned earlier.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-085","language":"ja","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"二つの公演は同時刻だ。さっき話に出た方が見たい。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-086","language":"zh","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"架上有一个空罐和一个纸盒，里面有字条。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-086","language":"en","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"There's a tin and a cardboard box on the shelf. There's a note inside.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-086","language":"ja","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"棚に缶と紙箱があって、中にメモが入っている。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-087","language":"zh","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"她和姐姐都拿着围巾，她的是绿色的。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-087","language":"en","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"She and her sister each have a scarf. Hers is green.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-087","language":"ja","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"彼女も姉もマフラーを持っている。彼女のは緑色だ。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-088","language":"zh","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"我把两把伞都拿下来了，哪把是你的那把？","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-088","language":"en","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"I brought both umbrellas down. Which one is yours?","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-088","language":"ja","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"傘を二本とも下ろした。あなたのってどれ？","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-089","language":"zh","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"先放下这个，再拿刚才那个。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-089","language":"en","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"Put this down first, then pick up the one from before.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-089","language":"ja","category":"ambiguous_reference","text":"まずこれを置いて、それからさっきのを取って。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-090","language":"zh","category":"coined_word","text":"我把等水烧开的空档叫“壶隙”。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-090","language":"en","category":"coined_word","text":"I call the pause while the kettle boils a “kettlegap.”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-090","language":"ja","category":"coined_word","text":"お湯が沸くまでの間を「やかん間」と呼んでいる。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-091","language":"zh","category":"coined_word","text":"“窗糖”是我给玻璃上的冰花取的名字。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-091","language":"en","category":"coined_word","text":"“Window candy” is my name for frost patterns on glass.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-091","language":"ja","category":"coined_word","text":"窓の霜の模様に「窓あめ」と名付けた。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-092","language":"zh","category":"coined_word","text":"我们家的小推车有个绰号，叫“慢轮虫”。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-092","language":"en","category":"coined_word","text":"Our little cart has a nickname: “slowwheel bug.”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-092","language":"ja","category":"coined_word","text":"うちの台車には「のろ輪むし」というあだ名がある。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-093","language":"zh","category":"coined_word","text":"我新造了个词“雨签”，指夹在雨天那页的书签。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-093","language":"en","category":"coined_word","text":"I coined “rainmark” for a bookmark left on the page I read on a rainy day.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-093","language":"ja","category":"coined_word","text":"雨の日に読んだページのしおりを「雨しるべ」と名付けた。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-094","language":"zh","category":"coined_word","text":"今晚试试“照叶步”吧，就是沿路找发亮的叶子。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-094","language":"en","category":"coined_word","text":"Let's try a “leafglint walk” tonight: look for shiny leaves as we go.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-094","language":"ja","category":"coined_word","text":"今夜は「葉っぱ光り歩き」をしよう。道すがら光る葉を探すんだ。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-095","language":"zh","category":"coined_word","text":"我把整理抽屉前的犹豫叫“屉前雾”。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-095","language":"en","category":"coined_word","text":"I call my hesitation before tidying a drawer “drawerfog.”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-095","language":"ja","category":"coined_word","text":"引き出しを片付ける前の迷いを「ひきだし霧」と呼んでいる。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-096","language":"zh","category":"coined_word","text":"这里说的“纸鲸”就是我折的那条长纸船。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-096","language":"en","category":"coined_word","text":"By “paper whale” I mean that long paper boat I folded.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-096","language":"ja","category":"coined_word","text":"ここで言う「紙くじら」は、私が折った細長い紙の舟のこと。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-097","language":"zh","category":"coined_word","text":"我想给这个反光点起名叫“灯芽”。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-097","language":"en","category":"coined_word","text":"I'd like to name this spot of reflected light a “lampbud.”","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-097","language":"ja","category":"coined_word","text":"この光の反射に「灯り芽」という名前をつけたい。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-098","language":"zh","category":"coined_word","text":"“鞋岛”是我们给玄关那堆鞋起的外号。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-098","language":"en","category":"coined_word","text":"“Shoe island” is our nickname for the pile of shoes by the door.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-098","language":"ja","category":"coined_word","text":"玄関の靴の山を、うちでは「くつ島」と呼んでいる。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-099","language":"zh","category":"coined_word","text":"这团线老是滚走，所以我叫它“逃线球”。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-099","language":"en","category":"coined_word","text":"I call this ball of yarn a “runawool” because it keeps rolling away.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-099","language":"ja","category":"coined_word","text":"この毛糸玉はすぐ転がっていくので、「逃げまり」と呼んでいる。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-zh-100","language":"zh","category":"coined_word","text":"我用“页风”形容快速翻书时扑来的风。","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-en-100","language":"en","category":"coined_word","text":"I use “pagebreeze” for the puff of air when I flip through a book.","annotation":null}
{"id":"p5-13-ja-100","language":"ja","category":"coined_word","text":"本を勢いよくめくる時の風を「ページそよぎ」と呼ぶことにした。","annotation":null}
